    "lawCode": "Add §491-b, RPT L",
    "lawSection": "Real Property Tax Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S6240\n\nSPONSOR: OBERACKER\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the real property tax law, in relation to establishing a\nconservation easement agreement exemption in a town having a certain\npopulation\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo establish a conservation easement agreement exemption.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nAmends section 491-b of the real property tax law to establish a conser-\nvation easement agreement exemption in a town having a certain popu-\nlation.\n\n \nEXISTING LAW:\n\nNone\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe Town of Danby Planning Board has requested the introduction of this\nlegislation by Resolution Number 17 of 2020.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNone\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nUndetermined\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
